    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "lines/hotlines don't really fix the fact that im a joke now. like i have to walk into my neighbors house or my parents house and just face the reality that i failed at everything. i spent my whole life building this version of myself and now i'm just... this hollow thing. there's no coming back from this kinda shame. it's just a long, slow embarrassment until everything is gone.",
